sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant Proxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP
    participant OAuth as OpenShift OAuth Server<br/>/ OIDC Provider
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>TCP (optional TLS)
    participant Upstream as Upstream Service<br/>(e.g. example-app :8080)

    Note over Client,Upstream: Human User OAuth2 Flow

    Client->>Route: GET /protected-resource<br/>HTTPS (TLS 1.2+)
    Route->>Proxy: Forward (TLS terminated)<br/>HTTP :80 -> :4180

    alt No valid session cookie
        Proxy->>Client: 302 Redirect to /oauth2/start
        Client->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/start
        Proxy->>Client: 302 Redirect to OAuth Provider
        Client->>OAuth: Authorization Request
        OAuth->>Client: 302 Redirect with auth code
        Client->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/callback?code=xxx
        Proxy->>OAuth: Exchange code for tokens
        OAuth-->>Proxy: Access Token + ID Token
        Proxy->>Redis: Store session data<br/>(encrypted)
        Redis-->>Proxy: OK
        Proxy->>Client: Set-Cookie (encrypted session)<br/>302 Redirect to original URL
        Client->>Route: GET /protected-resource<br/>Cookie: _oauth2_proxy=xxx
        Route->>Proxy: Forward request
    end

    Proxy->>Redis: Validate/load session
    Redis-->>Proxy: Session data
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>+ X-Auth-Request-User<br/>+ X-Auth-Request-Email<br/>+ Authorization: Bearer token
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: Response (HTTPS)

    Note over Client,Upstream: Service Account Token Flow

    participant SA as Service Account Client

    SA->>Route: GET /api/resource<br/>Authorization: Bearer <sa-token>
    Route->>Proxy: Forward request
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST authentication/v1/TokenReview<br/>Token validation
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview response<br/>(authenticated: true/false)

    alt Token valid
        Proxy->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>+ identity headers
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Route: Response
        Route-->>SA: Response (HTTPS)
    else Token invalid
        Proxy-->>Route: 401 Unauthorized
        Route-->>SA: 401 Unauthorized
    end
